WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.799 --> 00:00:05.990
Hollywood lined up lots of high-profile horror
projects in 2017, from a revival of the Saw

00:00:05.990 --> 00:00:09.990
franchise to a creepy new take on Stephen
King's It.

00:00:09.990 --> 00:00:13.950
And in 2018, there seems to be plenty more
where that came from.

00:00:13.950 --> 00:00:18.730
Strap in, because the future looks dark in
the best, possible way.

00:00:18.730 --> 00:00:20.179
A Quiet Place

00:00:20.179 --> 00:00:24.869
Plot details for A Quiet Place are being kept
tightly under wraps in advance of its April

00:00:24.869 --> 00:00:30.339
2018 release, but screenwriters Scott Beck
and Bryan Woods have been on an upward trajectory

00:00:30.339 --> 00:00:35.000
ever since they earned a top fifty spot in
Matt Damon and Ben Affleck's Project Greenlight

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:36.000
competition.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:40.469
While their 2015 debut feature Nightlight
wasn't particularly well-received, their spec

00:00:40.469 --> 00:00:45.289
script for this new project was good enough
to be purchased outright by Paramount — and

00:00:45.289 --> 00:00:50.769
to attract Hollywood power couple John Krasinski
and Emily Blunt, who will be onscreen together

00:00:50.769 --> 00:00:55.870
for the first time… unless you count this
Oscar-worthy performance on late night TV.

00:00:55.870 --> 00:00:57.280
"You're not married anymore."

00:00:58.400 --> 00:00:59.160
"John?"

00:01:04.400 --> 00:01:05.400
Slender Man

00:01:05.409 --> 00:01:09.560
Veteran TV director Sylvain White will helm
this adaptation of one of the most well-known

00:01:09.560 --> 00:01:11.230
internet memes of all time.

00:01:11.230 --> 00:01:15.820
The Slender Man has stalked the Web since
2009, when a Photoshop contest produced a

00:01:15.820 --> 00:01:20.020
picture of the tall, thin, faceless stalker
of hapless children.

00:01:20.020 --> 00:01:25.020
Sony/Screen Gems has slated Slender Man for
release on May 18, 2018.

00:01:25.020 --> 00:01:29.560
And while details are scant on the film's
plot, lovers of creepy internet memes have

00:01:29.560 --> 00:01:32.690
a pretty good idea what to expect.

00:01:32.690 --> 00:01:33.690
Meg

00:01:33.690 --> 00:01:37.910
Meg is a joint American/Chinese production
whose title doesn't give away a whole lot

00:01:37.910 --> 00:01:44.070
— unless you know that "Meg" is short for
Megalodon, a giant prehistoric shark.

00:01:44.070 --> 00:01:49.040
The film's international cast will portray
a deep-sea research team that comes nose-to-nose

00:01:49.040 --> 00:01:52.320
with the terrifying creature when their submersible
craft is disabled.

00:01:57.960 --> 00:02:03.410
Jason Statham stars as a Navy captain and
expert diver, with Rainn Wilson and Ruby Rose

00:02:03.410 --> 00:02:04.680
in supporting roles.

00:02:04.680 --> 00:02:08.751
The Chinese lead, Li Bingbing, is a veteran
actress who you might recognize from the most

00:02:08.751 --> 00:02:11.000
recent installments of the Transformers and
Resident Evil series.

00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:15.640
We'll have to wait until August 10, 2018 to
get a look at Meg — but that look will be

00:02:15.640 --> 00:02:20.950
in 3D IMAX and will involve Jason Statham
fighting a giant shark, so it should be worth

00:02:20.950 --> 00:02:22.409
the wait.

00:02:22.409 --> 00:02:23.409
Cadaver

00:02:23.409 --> 00:02:28.590
Shay Mitchell makes the jump from TV's Pretty
Little Liars to big-screen horror with Cadaver,

00:02:28.590 --> 00:02:32.010
an intriguing project also starring Castle's
Stana Katic.

00:02:32.010 --> 00:02:36.130
Mitchell stars as a morgue technician and
disgraced former cop, whose late-night shifts

00:02:36.130 --> 00:02:40.760
take a turn for the sinister when she receives
a badly brutalized corpse.

00:02:40.760 --> 00:02:41.760
Kinda like this:

00:02:41.760 --> 00:02:45.130
"You'll see human heads without bodies…"

00:02:45.130 --> 00:02:50.100
Audiences will have to wait until August 24,
2018 to get a look at Cadaver.

00:02:50.100 --> 00:02:54.120
But director Diederik Van Rooijen is already
onto his next project — he's been tapped

00:02:54.120 --> 00:02:58.470
to handle an upcoming remake of Alfred Hitchcock's
classic The Birds.

00:02:58.470 --> 00:02:59.819
Halloween

00:02:59.819 --> 00:03:04.900
Reboots of classic horror franchises haven't
exactly been cinematic gold in recent years,

00:03:04.900 --> 00:03:09.010
with new installments of Nightmare on Elm
Street and Friday the 13th leaving fans wondering

00:03:09.010 --> 00:03:11.840
if these franchises were better off dead.

00:03:11.840 --> 00:03:17.430
Since Rob Zombie remade Halloween in 2007
and did a sequel to it in 2009, we understand

00:03:17.430 --> 00:03:22.630
if you're not too excited about a new Halloween,
but here's the thing, you should be, for one

00:03:22.630 --> 00:03:23.630
key reason.

00:03:23.630 --> 00:03:24.960
"This is my moment!"

00:03:24.960 --> 00:03:30.060
Eastbound &amp; Down star Danny McBride and producer
David Gordon Green came together to work on

00:03:30.060 --> 00:03:33.490
the new film, which will serve as a sequel
to the first two films:

00:03:33.490 --> 00:03:35.870
"I think tension is what it's all about.

00:03:35.870 --> 00:03:38.470
Keeping that tension and keeping people's
stomach in knots."

00:03:38.470 --> 00:03:44.050
Michael Myers will return to theaters on October
19, 2018, just in time for the scariest night

00:03:44.050 --> 00:03:45.140
of the year.

00:03:45.140 --> 00:03:46.650
The Strangers 2

00:03:46.650 --> 00:03:51.110
The Strangers was a surprise hit in 2008,
and not many fans were expecting the second

00:03:51.110 --> 00:03:56.110
installment — which was announced way back
in 2009 — to actually see the light of day.

00:03:56.110 --> 00:04:00.950
But a decade after the first film hit theaters,
it's coming, with original director Johannes

00:04:00.950 --> 00:04:04.540
Roberts and writer Bryan Bertino on board.

00:04:04.540 --> 00:04:09.120
Christina Hendricks leads the cast of the
film, which has an as-yet-undetermined release

00:04:09.120 --> 00:04:10.720
date in 2018.

00:04:10.720 --> 00:04:15.270
What we do know is that it reportedly takes
place at a trailer park in the middle of nowhere

00:04:15.270 --> 00:04:18.889
during a power outage, where an appearance
by the malevolent Sackhead and Pin-Up Girl

00:04:18.889 --> 00:04:21.200
would definitely be something to scream about.

00:04:25.020 --> 00:04:26.590
Nosferatu

00:04:26.590 --> 00:04:32.440
The Witch is widely considered to be among
the scariest films of 2015, a unique and ambitious

00:04:32.440 --> 00:04:34.569
debut by director Robert Eggers.

00:04:34.569 --> 00:04:38.499
And for his follow-up, Eggers isn't scaling
back on his ambition.

00:04:38.499 --> 00:04:44.740
He'll be helming a remake of the seminal 1922
horror classic Nosferatu, an undertaking only

00:04:44.740 --> 00:04:51.210
attempted once before — in 1979, by acclaimed
German filmmaker Werner Herzog.

00:04:51.210 --> 00:04:56.430
Eggers is a lifelong fan of the original film,
and has even mounted a stage production, twice.

00:04:56.430 --> 00:05:01.659
It's safe to say the remake is in very good
hands — and if The Witch is any indication,

00:05:01.659 --> 00:05:05.990
fans might be in for the creepiest vampire
flick in years.

00:05:05.990 --> 00:05:06.990
Abruptio

00:05:06.990 --> 00:05:12.680
Buffy the Vampire Slayer's James Marsters
stars in this intriguing film, playing a down-on-his-luck

00:05:12.680 --> 00:05:17.380
regular Joe who wakes up one morning with
a bomb implanted in his neck.

00:05:17.380 --> 00:05:18.939
And there's one hell of a twist:

00:05:18.939 --> 00:05:22.509
"It's the sickest stuff you can imagine, but
they're all gonna be puppets."

00:05:22.509 --> 00:05:28.860
That's right: all the film's roles will be
performed by life-sized, realistic latex puppets.

00:05:28.860 --> 00:05:33.240
And it's got a hell of a supporting cast,
including comedian-turned-horror mastermind

00:05:33.240 --> 00:05:34.499
Jordan Peele.

00:05:34.500 --> 00:05:39.240
Abruptio will hit theaters sometime in 2018
— and we can only hope we're ready.

00:05:47.540 --> 00:05:48.539
Winchester

00:05:48.539 --> 00:05:53.990
Now this looks really cool, Winchester is
inspired by the true and very bizarre story

00:05:53.990 --> 00:05:59.180
of firearm heiress Sarah Winchester, whose
mansion is the stuff of legend.

00:06:00.360 --> 00:06:02.720
"A house shrouded in mystery and speculation.

00:06:02.720 --> 00:06:09.580
A house that has been the source of one of
the most unusual legends in California history."

00:06:09.580 --> 00:06:13.780
Winchester supposedly believed that the ghosts
of people killed by her family's firearms

00:06:14.300 --> 00:06:18.180
would haunt her forever — unless she never
stopped building.

00:06:18.180 --> 00:06:23.490
Rotating shifts of carpenters worked on the
mansion until Winchester's death in 1922,

00:06:23.490 --> 00:06:27.180
creating an endless series of rooms, nooks
and hallways.

00:06:27.180 --> 00:06:33.771
"There’s odd little corridors that maybe
once went somewhere… but the unusual never

00:06:33.780 --> 00:06:34.820
really stops in this house."

00:06:35.949 --> 00:06:40.839
The upcoming film is a supernatural period
piece, written and directed by identical twins

00:06:40.839 --> 00:06:46.999
Peter and Michael Spierig, who were behind
the 2009 sci-fi/horror thriller Daybreakers.

00:06:46.999 --> 00:06:51.949
But key to the project is the casting of Helen
Mirren in the lead role, bringing the kind

00:06:51.949 --> 00:06:55.610
of acting chops that can elevate any material.

00:06:55.610 --> 00:06:59.919
Winchester is slated for release on February
23, 2018.

00:06:59.919 --> 00:07:00.919
Thanks for watching!

00:07:00.919 --> 00:07:03.659
Click the Looper icon to subscribe to our
YouTube channel.

00:07:03.659 --> 00:07:06.250
Plus check out all this cool stuff we know
you'll love, too!

